OL,3,GNEWSAApplication submitted for town
OL,4,Acentre flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company behind a town centre
OL,7,Fredevelopment project has submitted the
OL,8,Fplanning application.
OL,10,FDemolition of the old M&S and BHS site
OL,11,Fon Abington Street in Northampton was
OL,12,Fcompleted earlier this year.
OL,14,FThe plans include over 250 new homes,
OL,15,Fgardens, a mix of retail and leisure
OL,16,Funits on the ground floor.
OL,18,FAndrew Davison, development director at
OL,19,FCapital&Centric, said: "Northampton
OL,20,Fdeserves better than a gap in its High
OL,21,FStreet, and that's exactly what we're
OL,22,Fhere to fix."
